<div class="mandarin-hanzi">手机</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">shǒujī</div>

''Meaning:'' mobile phone  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我把手机放在桌子上。 — Wǒ bǎ shǒujī fàng zài zhuōzi shang. — I put my phone on the table.

!! Usage note
手机 (shǒujī) is a mobile phone, contrasting with a landline telephone (座机, zuòjī). 打电话 (dǎ diànhuà) means 'make a phone call', regardless of device.
